{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12273","headline":"送陆贽擢第还苏州 · 钱起","name":"送陆贽擢第还苏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡路归何早，云间喜擅名。\n思亲卢橘熟，带雨客帆轻。\n夜火临津驿，晨钟隔浦城。\n华亭养仙羽，计日再飞鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}